title: Global Windows Remote Open/Close Enable
raw_community_title: Global window open/close using keyfob
category: Windows and Mirrors
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2023
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: 'Only works on the front windows because one-touch is not enabled in the back
  windows. After changes, go into Sync (Settings > Vehicle > Windows) and enable Remote
  Open and/or Remote Close. Open: press and hold unlock on fob for 3+ seconds. Close:
  press and hold lock for 3+ seconds. Cancel: press lock or unlock again.'
